TY  - JOUR
TI  - A Microsimulation Analysis of the Distributional Impact over the Three Waves of the COVID-19 Crisis in Ireland
AU  - O’Donoghue, Cathal
AU  - Sologon, Denisa M
AU  - Kyzyma, Iryna
AU  - McHale, John
VL  - 14
IS  - 2
PY  - 2021
DA  - 2021/08/31
